WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.880
From October 1st, permanent residency applicants in Japan need a 30-year pension pot. This is Omni View Asia Pacific, Episode 3. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. Household income has to beat the Japanese average, and that test reaches back to filings made since April, Al Jazeera reports. Applicants also have to show they can use Japanese. The Immigration Services Agency says foreigners should live independently, with a stable life and no risk

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:35.140
of becoming a burden. Abdul, a tech engineer from Bangladesh, who has spent nearly eight

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:40.220
years in northern Tokyo, is filing for residency and for citizenship, and he has started

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.700
hunting work outside the country. He asked Maught to be named.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:50.060
Sarah Nilkin, an American here 14 years, filed just before the change was announced. If

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:55.060
that file fails, she plans to seek citizenship, and that would mean giving up her United States

00:00:55.060 --> 00:01:00.660
passport, because Japan does not allow dual nationality. Across the region, a deep

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.540
depression crossed the Andhra Pradesh coast near Kalinga Patnam on Thursday, and

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:10.080
Odisha then moved people off low ground, the Hindu reports. The paper puts

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:15.560
that evacuation at over 8,000 after landslides, flooded streets, fallen trees

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:20.400
and damaged houses. The India Meteorological Department said coastal gusts could

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:24.660
hit 70 kilometers an hour and told fishermen to stay ashore until Friday

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:30.180
morning. The Nagavali was expected to run at about 60,000 kusecks by Friday afternoon,

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:36.760
with Visiana Garam, Srikakulam, and Parvathy Pura Maniam on alert. Early estimates put

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:42.020
loss crops at more than 10,000 acres around Rajam, bananas and vegetables hardest hit.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:48.540
Collector S. Ram Sunderredi said low-lying Vangara, by the Madhu Velasa Reservoir, had already

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:54.440
been cleared as inflows hit that same 60,000. In Sydney, a coroner has heard how nurse

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.640
Felicity Melville took a dying toddler past the doctors who were still waiting.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:05.420
The Sydney Morning Herald reports, Joe Masa was too. He died in September 2024 of what the

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:10.800
inquest called a strikingly unusual complication. And that death pushed the men's government toward

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.160
ending the Northern Beach's hospital's public-private partnership. After his mother,

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:21.420
Eloise Masa said she had kept warning staff. Melville came on as team leader at 10 in the morning

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:27.260
on September 14, nearly three hours after Joe arrived. On Thursday, she told the court

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:32.860
in tears that sunken dark eyes and modeled skin made it instantly plain he was very,

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:37.540
very unwell. She left the bed twice for missing cables and broken stickers,

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:42.000
never got a heart rate reading, and did record breathing at 57 a minute.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.780
A registrar told the family they would wait for an ultrasound. She wanted action,

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:52.240
Called her nurse unit manager, rolled Joe toward resuscitation without being asked, lifted

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:56.120
him onto a smaller trolley and told another doctor she was really worried.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:57.380
That doctor came.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:03.440
Also today, the Hindu says India's Supreme Court asked Goa police to answer to Room Tej

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:08.040
Paul's appeal of a 10-year sentence, and took notice of Goa's bid to lengthen it.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.560
He surrendered in Goa on September 14.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:16.840
The Hindu also says Tamil Nadu's police chief, Mahesh Kumar Agrawal, ordered an all-woman

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.240
team, under the Chennai Commissioner, onto the case involving R. Viramani.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:27.640
ABC News says three unions voted for stoppages and work bands at Sydney Water after a payroll

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.640
system has paid people wrong, or late, since July.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:36.480
The South China Morning Post says Deputy Prime Minister Gon Kim Young, speaking in Singapore,

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:41.440
for, once the next China projects in artificial intelligence and the green economy, after

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.940
Sujo in 1994 and Tianjin in 2008.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:50.300
In the wider world, President Xi Jinping sat down to a state dinner with President Donald

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:54.040
Trump in the White House East Room, the South China Morning Post reports.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:58.940
The paper says the room was built out of old symbolism, not a fresh announced deal.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:04.980
The first toast was Schramsburg Blanc de Noirs, picked to echo the 1972 toast to peace

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:07.220
between Richard Nixon and Joe and Lai.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.100
The evening also nodded to ping pong diplomacy.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:11.980
The case on both sides,

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.700
over two North Korean soldiers sent to the South,

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.380
is whether that handover should have stayed secret.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:18.560
Jan Hap reports.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.980
President Lee Jae-miung wrote on X on Thursday

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.140
that Ukraine broke a non-disclosure deal by speaking.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.480
A day earlier, President Volodymyr Zelensky

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.460
told the United Nations General Assembly in New York

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:34.040
that Ukraine had recently sent the two soldiers.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:39.120
leaders. Lee said silence was right in every respect, because disclosure can cause many

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:44.200
problems, and the two governments had agreed to keep it quiet. He calls the matter sensitive

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:49.980
enough to shake diplomacy, national security, and the peninsula itself. He says publishing

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:55.220
it would be cruel and irresponsible, whatever it does to ties between the Koreas, and whether

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:57.860
it could get someone killed or hurt the national interest.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:03.500
Seoul had already declined to confirm the men had arrived, pointing to danger for them, and

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.880
for relatives still in the north.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:10.460
Ukraine's presidential office told Yonhaap it revealed only the transfer, not the long

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.600
details, and that hiding the whole thing would have looked strange.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.000
It says the handover ran through direct talks with Seoul.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.880
Both sides accounts treat the transfer as real.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:24.140
Lee says he does not know why Ukraine spoke, and that he regrets it.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:29.320
There is no sign of progress to report today, no measured recovery or finished project

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.240
with a figure on it.

